use firn/tags

graphviz is a Module
graphviz is tagged doom-emacs

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.graphviz.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.graphviz]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."graphviz"."enable": enable "Graphviz graph visualization"
